  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Iko Ike**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Ripple Intro Jam**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Post Space Jam**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2024-05-30.Konaking** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 186 min [1]\n- **deadco2024-05-30.Gerry**: source not stated; 23 songs; 186 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Crowd / 1st Set, Crowd / 2nd Set [1]\n- The show was strongly dedicated to the memory and life of Bill Walton [1]\n- Lineup: Bobby Weir on rhythm guitar, Mickey Hart on percussion, John Mayer on lead guitar, Oteil Burbridge on bass [1]\n- The show was strongly dedicated to the memory and life of Bill Walton [2]\n- Lineup: Bobby Weir on rhythm guitar, Mickey Hart on percussion, John Mayer on lead guitar, Oteil Burbridge on bass [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2024-05-30.Konaking**: taped by Oklahoma Jason; transferred by Hunter S; source: iPhone [1]\n- **deadco2024-05-30.Gerry**: taped by Gerry; transferred by Hunter S; source: iPhone [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Honateez: [Dead And Company Show Sphere Las Vegas May 2024 Fan Gifts Home Decor Poster Canvas - Honateez](https://honateez.com/product/dead-and-company-show-sphere-las-vegas-may-2024-fan-gifts-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [4]",
